{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","name_native":"সুনান আন-নাসায়ী","section":{"51":"The Book of Drinks"},"section_detail":{"51":{"hadithnumber_first":5540,"hadithnumber_last":5758,"arabicnumber_first":5540,"arabicnumber_last":5758,"name_native":"পানীয় অধ্যায়"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":5573,"arabicnumber":5573,"text":"যিয়াদ ইবন আইয়্যুব (রহঃ) ... আবূ হুরায়রা (রাঃ) থেকে বর্ণিত। তিনি বলেন, খেজুর ও আঙ্গুর এ দু'টি গাছ (-এর ফল) থেকেই মদ তৈরি হয়।","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":51,"hadith":35}}]}